This output is extracted from the last assertion statement in the code (line 138). The assertion is comparing the returned index from the IndexOf method to the count of the ArrayList to verify if the new item has been inserted as expected.
Similarly, for the LastIndexOfContract method, the assertion is as follows:
<code>
Debug.Assert(New_Ret >= 0 && Old_arrListLastIndexOfX <= New_Ret);
</code>
This assertion checks if `New_Ret` is not negative and is less than or equal to the old index value. If you run into issues with IndexOutOfRangeException or null reference exceptions, this would be useful for testing.--------------------
